+# Hogflows
+
+The Node worker's workflow runtime: the executor runs a workflow step by step through its step handlers, with billing, quota and conversion watching behind single doors
+
+## invariants
+- conversion-watcher-through-executor: Only the executor builds conversion watchers
+  protects: nodejs/src/cdp/services/hogflows/conversion-watcher.ts
+  chokepoint: nodejs/src/cdp/services/hogflows/hogflow-executor.service.ts
+  because: pinning a goal and clamping its window to MAX_CONVERSION_WINDOW_MINUTES are the executor's decisions, moved out of the class only to keep it small (PR #82953); a second builder would pin goals under its own rules. The coherence/chokepoint oxlint rule fails any non-test import of the module from another file.
+  refuted: staged nodejs/src/cdp/services/hogflows/zz-refute-bypass.ts importing conversion-watcher.ts -> oxlint -c nodejs/.oxlintrc.nodejs.json reported coherence(chokepoint) naming conversion-watcher-through-executor; clean after deleting it (2026-09-30)
+  kinds: none
